# ─── Portable toolchain (regenerable, ~1GB — NEVER commit) ───
toolchain/

# ─── Gradle / build outputs ───
.gradle/
**/build/
**/.cxx/
**/.externalNativeBuild/

# ─── Machine-specific SDK path ───
local.properties
**/local.properties

